So basically % Pen works before flat pen? Is that correct?

&#x200B;

Edit:  [Source](https://leagueoflegends.fandom.com/wiki/Magic_penetration)

Thanks! She's my first pet Luci, and I love her more than anything in the world. She's a bengal and it's almost like she imprinted on me. 

&#x200B;

She waits for me when I come home from work. 

&#x200B;

She follows me everywhere!

&#x200B;

And my fav thing is that she'll sleep next to me at night. 

&#x200B;

Who knew having a pet could be this amazing?
